$DATUM 2-((S)-2-((S)-2-(3,4-Dichlorophenyl)-N-methy4-(4-(N-propysulfonamido)piperidin-1-yl)butanamido)-3-phenylpropanamido)ethyl
carbamic acid benzyl ester {(S,S)-S17}. A solution of aldehyde (S,S)-9b
(361 mg, 0.62 mmol) and secondary amine 10a (150 mg, 0.68 mmol, 1.1
equiv) in anhydrous CH2Cl2 (10 mL) was stirred at room temperature for 16
h in the presence of molecular sieve (3 A MS, oven-dried, 1 g). Sodium
triacetoxyborohydride (170 mg, 0.8 mmol, 1.3 equiv) was added and the
reaction mixture was stirred at room temperature for 8 h. The solution
was then filtered, transferred into a separatory funnel, and diluted with
Et2O (150 mL). The organic layer was successively washed with an aqueous
saturated NaHCO3 solution (2 x 50 mL), water (2 x 50 mL) and brine (20
mL). Once the layers were separated, the combined aqueous layers were
extracted with Et2O (80 mL). The combined organic extracts were dried
over Na2SO4, filtered and evaporated under reduced pressure. The residue
was dissolved in a minimum of CH2Cl2 and purified using flash column
chromatography (silica gel, 50 g, CH2Cl2:i-PrOH:NH4OH, 98:2:0.2 →
94:6:0.6) to afford amine (S,S)-S17. Colorless oil, yield (367 mg , 75%).
[α]D -10.5 (c 1.0, CHCl3); IR (film) νmax 3336, 3028, 2936, 2810, 1715,
1644, 1525, 1469, 1455, 1326, 1259, 1172, 1142, 1031, 1010, 752 cm-1; 1H
NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm): 7.35-7.25 (m, 7H), 7.25-7.15 (m, 2H),
7.15-7.10 (m, 3H), 7.05 (dd, J = 6.3, 1.5 Hz, 1H), 6.33 (bs, 1H), 5.28
(dd, J = 7.2, 4.8 Hz, 1H), 5.05-5.00 (bs, 3H), 3.7-3.6 (m, 1H), 3.55-3.45
(m, 1H), 3.3-3.1 (m, 5H), 3.05-3.00 (m, 2H), 2.94 (dd, J = 11.1, 3.6 Hz,
1H), 2.85-2.75 (m, 1H), 2.82 (s, 3H), 2.78 (s, 3H), 2.65-2.55 (m, 1H),
2.05-1.90 (m, 3H), 1.90-1.75 (m, 2H), 1.75-1.55 (m, 7H), 0.86 (t, J = 5.4
Hz, 3H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm): 173.6, 170.5, 156.8, 139.45,
137.05, 136.6, 133.05, 131.6, 131.0, 129.95, 129.0, 128.75, 128.7, 128.3
(2xC), 127.45, 126.95, 66.95, 58.0, 56.3, 55.45, 53.55, 53.0, 45.85,
41.1, 40.6, 39.9, 33.85, 32.5, 31.6, 31.35, 31.2, 25.0, 11.4; HRMS calcd.
for C39H51Cl2N5NaO6S [M+Na]+: 810.28293, found: 810.28411; HRMS calcd.
for C39H52Cl2N5O6S [M+H]+: 788.30099, found: 788.30284; MS (ESI) [M+Na]+
810.27, [M+H]+ 788.20.
