(S)-1-((2S,5R)-5-(((6,7-Dihydro-[1,4]oxathiino[2,3-c]-pyridazin-3-yl)methyl)amino)tetrahydro-2H-pyran-2-yl)-2-(3-fluoro-6-methoxy-1,5-naphthyridin-4-yl)ethan-1-ol
(32d). Starting from 30a (2.0 g, 6.27 mmol) and 25 (1.34 g, 6.27 mmol),
32d (2.06 g, 67% yield) was prepared according to the general procedure
E. Off-white solid. mp = 129 °C. 1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ: 8.72 (s, 1
H), 8.24 (d, J = 9.0 Hz, 1 H), 7.53 (s, 1 H), 7.19 (d, J = 9.0 Hz, 1 H),
