H), 3.31 (overlaid m, 1 H), 3.25-3.30 (m, 2 H), 3.05-3.15 (m, 2 H), 2.90
(t, J = 10.7 Hz, 1 H), 2.41 (m, 1 H), 2.20 (m, 1 H), 2.02 (m, 1 H), 1.65
(m, 1 H); 1.50 (m, 1 H), 1.17 (m, 1 H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ:
162.7, 159.9, 157.5 (d, J = 256 Hz), 156.7, 141.9 (d, J = 6 Hz), 140.6,
138.6 (d, J = 2 Hz), 138.2 (d, J = 29 Hz), 129.2 (d, J = 13 Hz), 125.8,
