$DATUM ethyl (3-exo)-3-{[(3S)-3-(2-oxo-2,
3-dihydro-1H-indole-1-yl)pyrrolidine-1-yl]methyl}-8-azabicyclo[3.2.1]octane-8-carboxylate
HCl salt (1). To a solution of 14 (1.0 g, 4.94 mmol) and
ethyl-(3-exo)-3-formyl-8-azabicyclo[3.2.1]octane-8-carboxylate (17) (1.04
g, 4.94 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (25 ml) was added NaBH(OAc)3 (1.57 g, 7.42 mmol)
and stirred for 4 h at room temperature. The reaction mixture was
quenched by sat. aq NaHCO3 soln and extracted with CHCl3. Organic layer
was washed with brine, dried over Na2SO4 and filtrated. The filtrate was
concentrated in vacuo and the residue was purified by amino silica gel
column chromatography (hexane-EtOAc) to give a pale yellow oil (1.74 g).
4 M HCl in dioxane (8 ml) was added to the oil and evaporated under
reduced pressure. Then, the solid was obtained and recrystalized from THF
to afford the title compound. Compound 1 as a white crystal, yield 1.33
g, 66%. Mp: 109°C. 1H NMR (CDCl3, δ ppm): 7.75 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H),
7.22-7.26 (m, 2H), 7.03 (t, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H), 5.22 (dq, J = 3.4, 9.2 Hz,
1H), 4.27 (br, 2H), 4.14 (q, J = 7.0 Hz, 2H), 3.50 (s, 2H), 3.08-3.13 (m,
1H), 3.01 (dd, J = 2.7, 10.0 Hz, 1H), 2.34-2.45 (m, 2H), 2.20-2.26 (m,
2H), 1.44-2.12 (m, 11H), 1.26 (t, J = 7.0 Hz, 3H). 13C NMR (CDCl3, δ
ppm): 175.9, 153.7, 143.6, 128.3, 124.8, 123.9, 123.2, 108.4, 77.2, 61.3,
61.0, 52.8, 50.2, 36.3, 35.9, 28.8, 28.0, 26.8, 14.7. MS (ESI) m/z: 398
(M+H). HRMS (ESI) calcd for C23H32N3O3 (M+H): 398.2444, found: 398.2438.
[α]24D: +27.6 (c = 1.0, CHCl3).
